      ],
      "en": "(and the life was revealed, and we have seen, and testify, and declare to you the life, the eternal life, which was with the Father, and was revealed to us);",
      "ko": "이 생명이 나타내신바 된지라 이 영원한 생명을 우리가 보았고 증거하여 너희에게 전하노니 이는 아버지와 함께 계시다가 우리에게 나타내신바 된 자니라",
      "source_text_hash": "2712dbf0ac1c8db83b29fc81fd18972a6b2300ecdcc74ac8dda52a09d362a7d8",
      "translation_text_hash": "24fa649ce203807c91d36236bd3c7d980c77a54048b1e79b572f44685c91aae6",
